# llvm-tools runs on the shared runtime (base pin) plus the C++
# runtime its binaries DT_NEEDED (libstdc++/libgcc_s, read off the
# staged binaries 2026-10-23). Base llvm pulls zlib/libffi/libxml2
# transitively; gcc-libs is named here so the tools survive any
# future trim of the base runtime deps.
gcc-libs
